      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(protocol): remove duplicate SessionWorktreeInfo and SessionsCreateResult type exports",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\nIn commits `fda01a64a70470af180f1e1868ac0e82c52cc1f7` and `704c58468667a4e89b17dc4f693c6f3d621cf1bf`, duplicate type exports for `SessionWorktreeInfo` and `SessionsCreateResult` were introduced in `packages/gateway-protocol/src/index.ts`. This causes compilation and typecheck errors (`Duplicate identifier`) in downstream TypeScript consumers and prevents the type checking check-runs from passing.\n\nThis PR removes the duplicate type exports from the schema export block.\n\n## Evidence\nPassed typecheck checking:\n```\n$ pnpm check:test-types\n...\n$ node scripts/run-tsgo.mjs -p test/tsconfig/tsconfig.extensions.test.json --incremental --tsBuildInfoFile .artifacts/tsgo-cache/extensions-test.tsbuildinfo\n```",
        "branch": "fix/protocol-duplicate-worktree-exports",
